error[E0431]: a precision (`.2`) applies only to floats
  --> tests/programs/m44/e0431.la:4:16
  |
4 |     println("{n:.2}");
  |                ^^^
  |
  = help: a specifier is `[[fill]align][#][0][width][.precision][kind]`, e.g. `{x:>8.2}`

error[E0431]: `x`, `X`, `b` and `o` apply only to integers
  --> tests/programs/m44/e0431.la:5:16
  |
5 |     println("{f:x}");
  |                ^^
  |
  = help: a specifier is `[[fill]align][#][0][width][.precision][kind]`, e.g. `{x:>8.2}`

error[E0431]: `0` padding applies only to numbers
  --> tests/programs/m44/e0431.la:6:18
  |
6 |     println("{"s":05}");
  |                  ^^^
  |
  = help: a specifier is `[[fill]align][#][0][width][.precision][kind]`, e.g. `{x:>8.2}`

For more about E0431, run `lughac explain E0431`.
